@startuml audio-pipeline-lifecycle
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

title TigerPlayer - Media3 AudioProcessor Pipeline & Transition Lifecycle

box "Audio Sourcing & Decoders" #E8F0FE
participant "ResolvingDataSource\n(NavidromeUrlSigner)" as Source
participant "ExoPlayer Decoders\n(MediaCodec / FLAC / Opus)" as Decoder
end box

box "AudioProcessor Pipeline (DefaultAudioSink)" #FEF7E0
participant "AdaptiveDspEngine\n(PEQ / SVF / Reverb / Prism)" as DspEngine
participant "Look-Ahead Limiter\n(1024-sample circular buffer)" as Limiter
participant "FftProcessor\n(6-Band Spectral Engine)" as FftProc
participant "WaveformCaptureProcessor\n(RMS & Waveform Buffer)" as WaveProc
end box

box "Hardware Audio Subsystem" #FCE8E6
participant "Android AudioTrack\n(Audio HAL / Offload Sink)" as HAL
end box

box "Telemetry & Physical Senses" #E6F4EA
participant "AudioReactiveFrame\n(StateFlow)" as StateFlow
participant "UI Visualizers\n(Compose Canvas / Shaders)" as Visualizers
participant "VibratorManager\n(Haptic Motor Cooldown)" as Haptics
end box

== 1. Audio Processing & Telemetry Flow ==

Source -> Decoder: Stream uncompressed/compressed chunks
Decoder -> DspEngine: Raw PCM Audio Frames (Float / 16-bit PCM)
activate DspEngine

DspEngine -> DspEngine: Apply ReplayGain Normalization
DspEngine -> DspEngine: Process StateVariableFilters (Cytotoxic PEQ)
DspEngine -> DspEngine: Linkwitz-Riley 4th-order Stem Separation (Prism)
DspEngine -> DspEngine: Schroeder Hall Reverb (4 comb + 2 all-pass)

DspEngine -> Limiter: Pass processed audio frames
activate Limiter
Limiter -> Limiter: Inspect 5ms ahead in circular buffer
Limiter -> Limiter: Apply transparent true-peak limiting if peak > 1.0f (bypass on flat lossless)
Limiter --> DspEngine: Safe clipped-free PCM frames
deactivate Limiter

DspEngine -> FftProc: Forward safe PCM stream
deactivate DspEngine
activate FftProc

FftProc -> FftProc: 512/1024-pt Fast Fourier Transform
FftProc -> StateFlow: Emit 6-Band Spectral Energy & Flux
StateFlow -> Visualizers: Render 60/120 FPS Canvas & AGSL Shaders
StateFlow -> Haptics: Trigger Bass Beat Pulse (90ms refractory cooldown)

FftProc -> WaveProc: Forward PCM stream
deactivate FftProc
activate WaveProc

WaveProc -> WaveProc: Calculate RMS Amplitude & Downsample Waveform
WaveProc -> HAL: Deliver processed PCM frames to AudioTrack
deactivate WaveProc

== 2. Hardware Offload Transition Lifecycle (Mutex Guarded) ==

note over DspEngine, HAL
User toggles DSP / Offload mode:
Avoids loud clicks, pops, and driver faults during sink reconfiguration.
end note

[o-> DspEngine: Toggle Offload / System DSP
activate DspEngine #DarkSalmon
DspEngine -> DspEngine: Acquire offloadTransitionMutex
loop 8 Steps (20ms each)
    DspEngine -> HAL: Linear Volume Ramp Down (1.0 -> 0.0)
end

DspEngine -> DspEngine: Delay 350ms (Drain A2DP & HAL hardware buffers)

DspEngine -> HAL: Reconfigure AudioSink & TrackSelection (Offload Mode)

loop 8 Steps (40ms each)
    DspEngine -> HAL: Linear Volume Ramp Up (0.0 -> 1.0)
end
DspEngine -> DspEngine: Release offloadTransitionMutex
deactivate DspEngine

@enduml
